-**1. Fetch latest and derive your work bead:**
+**1. Fetch latest, derive your work bead, and claim it:**
 ```bash
 git fetch --prune origin
 CONVOY_STATUS=$(gc convoy status {{convoy_id}} --json)
@@ -88,6 +88,81 @@ if [ -z "$WORK_BEAD_ID" ]; then
